{"surah":99,"ayahs":["إِذَا زُلْزِلَتِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضُ زِلْزَالَهَا","وَأَخْرَجَتِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضُ أَثْقَالَهَا","وَقَالَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْإِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">سَٰ</span>نُ مَا لَهَا","يَوْمَئِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ذٍ تُ</span>حَدِّثُ أَخْبَارَهَا","بِأَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> رَبَّكَ أَوْحَىٰ لَهَا","يَوْمَئِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">ذٍ يَ</span>صْدُرُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>اسُ أَشْتَا<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">تًا لِّ</span>يُرَوْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> أَعْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">مَٰ</span>لَهُمْ","فَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">مَن يَ</span>عْمَلْ مِثْقَالَ ذَرَّةٍ خَيْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">رًا يَ</span>رَهُۥ","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">مَن يَ</span>عْمَلْ مِثْقَالَ ذَرَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ةٍ شَ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">رًّا يَ</span>رَهُۥ"]}